WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.916 --> 00:00:06.720
"Oops," Ben said as black vapor drifted from his pond scum soup.

2
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:15.526
It was Monday morning, and Ben was stuck in his least favorite class.

3
00:00:15.646 --> 00:00:31.733
Cooking was boring, and Ben was terrible at it.

4
00:00:34.656 --> 00:00:36.778
Winnie looked over from her workstation.

5
00:00:36.798 --> 00:00:39.480
"Ben, your soup is smoking."

6
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.762
"Yeah, I know."

7
00:00:42.943 --> 00:00:44.044
She wrinkled her nose.

8
00:00:44.064 --> 00:00:46.105
"What did you put in it?"

9
00:00:47.507 --> 00:00:49.668
Ben looked at all the jars on his counter.

10
00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:54.412
He saw dried lizard toes, rat tails, and several other items.

11
00:00:56.294 --> 00:00:56.914
He shrugged.

12
00:00:58.175 --> 00:01:00.737
"Honestly, I don't remember what I put in it."

13
00:01:01.738 --> 00:01:04.699
Winnie burst out laughing, and Ben joined in.

14
00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:09.602
The only good thing about Cooking class was that Winnie was in it.

15
00:01:11.123 --> 00:01:13.664
Mr. Icky pointed one of his tentacles at them.

16
00:01:13.684 --> 00:01:16.206
"What are you two laughing about?"

17
00:01:16.226 --> 00:01:19.528
"Uh, nothing," Ben said.

18
00:01:20.068 --> 00:01:22.429
Suddenly—Boom! Splat!

19
00:01:22.449 --> 00:01:25.411
"Oh, man!"

20
00:01:25.811 --> 00:01:26.572
Mog cried.

21
00:01:27.356 --> 00:01:29.237
Everyone turned to see what had happened.

22
00:01:30.158 --> 00:01:31.739
Green soup covered Mog.

23
00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:36.463
It dripped down his face and shirt, forming a puddle on the floor.

24
00:01:38.204 --> 00:01:41.166
A zombie who was staggering by slipped and fell.

25
00:01:46.429 --> 00:01:49.932
As Mog began to clean up the mess, the zombie just lay there.

26
00:01:49.952 --> 00:01:54.375
"Is that zombie going to get up?"

27
00:01:54.815 --> 00:01:55.436
Ben asked.

28
00:01:56.124 --> 00:01:58.065
"Eventually," Winnie said.

29
00:01:58.766 --> 00:01:59.986
Mog gritted his teeth.

30
00:02:00.006 --> 00:02:03.548
"I hate cooking!"

31
00:02:03.568 --> 00:02:05.930
"Now, now."

32
00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.171
Mr. Icky slid over to help.

33
00:02:08.191 --> 00:02:10.372
"We all make mistakes."

34
00:02:10.392 --> 00:02:13.093
"Poor Mog," Winnie whispered.

35
00:02:13.113 --> 00:02:15.375
"Poor me," Ben said.

36
00:02:16.395 --> 00:02:18.036
His soup had stopped smoking.

37
00:02:18.797 --> 00:02:21.058
Now it was making a strange humming sound.

38
00:02:21.078 --> 00:02:24.580
"Ooh!" Winnie's eyes went wide.

39
00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:29.931
"That sounds like the cute monster in the movie we saw last weekend."

40
00:02:32.233 --> 00:02:33.194
Ben smiled.

41
00:02:34.194 --> 00:02:37.257
He and Winnie had gone on a double date with Mog and Deb.

42
00:02:39.658 --> 00:02:41.860
They had seen a romantic monster movie.

43
00:02:43.161 --> 00:02:46.864
Mog complained during the whole movie because there were no explosions.

44
00:02:47.984 --> 00:02:49.846
But Ben kind of liked the movie.

45
00:02:51.227 --> 00:02:52.628
He didn't tell Mog that though.

46
00:02:54.024 --> 00:02:56.985
A three-eyed monster sprinkled something into her soup.

47
00:02:57.005 --> 00:03:01.246
"That smells wonderful!"

48
00:03:01.726 --> 00:03:03.126
a four-eyed monster said.

49
00:03:03.146 --> 00:03:04.707
"What did you put in it?"

50
00:03:04.727 --> 00:03:09.948
"Oh, just some rotten fungus flakes," the three-eyed monster said.

51
00:03:10.608 --> 00:03:13.209
Other monsters smiled as they stirred their soups.

52
00:03:13.949 --> 00:03:17.470
The pleasant smell of dirt and rotten vegetables filled the room.

53
00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:20.391
"Ugh," Ben mumbled.

54
00:03:20.411 --> 00:03:23.412
"Everyone's soup looks fine except for mine.

55
00:03:23.936 --> 00:03:25.297
I wish this class were over."

56
00:03:25.317 --> 00:03:29.019
"So," Winnie said without looking up.

57
00:03:29.599 --> 00:03:31.901
She was skimming some dead leaves from her soup.

58
00:03:31.921 --> 00:03:35.343
"Are there any plans for Saturday night?"

59
00:03:36.443 --> 00:03:38.064
Ben shot a quick look at Winnie.

60
00:03:38.084 --> 00:03:40.165
"Um, I don't know.

61
00:03:40.846 --> 00:03:44.167
Why?" "Uh, hello," Winnie said.

62
00:03:44.187 --> 00:03:45.508
"It's my birthday."

63
00:03:45.528 --> 00:03:47.449
"Oh, really?"

64
00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:49.611
Ben ran a hand through his hair.

65
00:03:49.631 --> 00:03:51.712
"I had no idea!

66
00:03:54.704 --> 00:03:56.545
I guess we should plan something, right?"

67
00:03:57.486 --> 00:03:59.367
Winnie gave Ben a suspicious look.

68
00:03:59.387 --> 00:04:04.031
"Gaby asked me to go to Monster Mall on Saturday afternoon.

69
00:04:04.451 --> 00:04:06.832
But that's weird because Gaby hates shopping.

70
00:04:08.253 --> 00:04:11.736
So I started to think that maybe you're all planning a party."

71
00:04:12.576 --> 00:04:14.658
She met Ben's eyes and stared at him.

72
00:04:16.319 --> 00:04:19.881
Ben looked away and pretended to read the label on a spice jar.

73
00:04:20.802 --> 00:04:23.384
Winnie could sometimes tell what someone was thinking.

74
00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:27.301
"Maybe Gaby just wants to buy you a birthday present."

75
00:04:27.321 --> 00:04:30.242
"Everyone, it's time to stop cooking!"

76
00:04:30.762 --> 00:04:33.083
Mr. Icky said before Winnie could reply.

77
00:04:33.103 --> 00:04:36.023
"We'll do a quick tasting before we clean up.

78
00:04:36.584 --> 00:04:39.164
Who wants to let us taste their soup first?"

79
00:04:40.245 --> 00:04:42.865
Several monsters raised their hands and claws.

80
00:04:44.006 --> 00:04:46.186
Ben gazed down at his soup and frowned.

81
00:04:46.206 --> 00:04:48.987
"Mine looks terrible," he thought.

82
00:04:49.007 --> 00:04:51.188
"Nobody will want to taste it."

83
00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:56.482
He quietly floated over to the trash can and dumped his soup.

84
00:04:58.983 --> 00:05:01.145
After class Ben was at his locker.

85
00:05:01.945 --> 00:05:04.587
Waldo poked his head out of a nearby classroom.

86
00:05:04.607 --> 00:05:06.588
"Psst, Ben!"

87
00:05:06.968 --> 00:05:07.628
he whispered.

88
00:05:07.648 --> 00:05:08.669
"Come here!"

89
00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:14.012
Ben went in, and Waldo closed the door behind him.

90
00:05:14.792 --> 00:05:17.974
Gaby, Deb, Mog, and some other monsters were there.

91
00:05:17.994 --> 00:05:20.856
"Quick meeting," Waldo said.

92
00:05:21.376 --> 00:05:24.058
"We need to discuss Winnie's surprise party."

93
00:05:24.078 --> 00:05:27.459
"She almost figured it out," Ben said.

94
00:05:27.479 --> 00:05:30.241
"I pretended to not know about any party."

95
00:05:30.261 --> 00:05:32.702
"That's good," Mog said.

96
00:05:32.722 --> 00:05:35.384
"Now it will be a real surprise!"

97
00:05:36.144 --> 00:05:37.685
Waldo pushed his glasses up.

98
00:05:37.705 --> 00:05:40.186
"Everyone knows what the plan is, right?"

99
00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:41.827
Gaby nodded.

100
00:05:41.847 --> 00:05:45.309
"I'm taking Winnie to Monster Mall on Saturday afternoon.

101
00:05:45.469 --> 00:05:47.230
We'll be back at her house by six o'clock."

102
00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:48.671
Deb spoke up.

103
00:05:48.691 --> 00:05:53.078
"While you two are at the mall, we'll set up for the party in Winnie's house."

104
00:05:53.838 --> 00:05:56.460
Everyone started discussing decorations and food.

105
00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:58.802
But Ben wasn't paying much attention.

106
00:05:59.502 --> 00:06:01.524
He was excited about Winnie's birthday.

107
00:06:02.564 --> 00:06:06.928
However, there was one big problem: he didn't know what to get for her.

108
00:06:07.828 --> 00:06:13.532
He'd thought about possible gifts for weeks, but so far he hadn't come up with any good ideas.

109
00:06:13.552 --> 00:06:17.916
"I still have five days," he told himself.

110
00:06:18.689 --> 00:06:20.999
"I'll find the perfect gift before the party."
